{"id":"verglichen","lemma":"verglichen","pos":"adj","rank":3944,"glosses":["compared, likened"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/De-at-verglichen.ogg/De-at-verglichen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wie verglichen Sie die beiden?","en":"How would you compare the two?","words":[{"g":"how"},null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"both","l":"beide"}]},{"text":"Wir haben seine Arbeit mit ihrer verglichen.","en":"We compared his work with hers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41453","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},null]},{"text":"Womit kann das verglichen werden?","en":"What can it be compared to?","words":[{"g":"with what, what…with"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Ein Buch kann mit einem Freund verglichen werden.","en":"A book can be compared to a friend.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29385","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"friend"},null,{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Ich habe mein Auto mit seinem verglichen.","en":"I compared my car with his.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]}]}